{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[Abmaj7]They asked me to give glo[Cm7]ry to God
Saying [Bbm7]the healer was [Abmaj7]a sinner
I stood before [Cm7]them with no fear
An[Bbm7]swering with steady [Abmaj7]and quiet spirit
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
One thing [Dbmaj7]I do know
I [Cm7]was blind and now I see
One thing I [Bbm7]do know
The light has [Abmaj7]broken through
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
They asked what he did to my [Cm7]eyes
How he [Bbm7]opened them to the [Abmaj7]day
I said I told you [Cm7]before
Why do you [Bbm7]ask me to speak a[Abmaj7]gain
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
One thing I do [Dbmaj7]know
I was blind [Cm7]and now I see
One thing I [Bbm7]do know
The light has [Abmaj7]broken through
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_bridge: Bridge}
[Dbmaj7]Do you want to become his dis[Cm7]ciples too
[Bbm7]Or stay where the darkness keeps its [Abmaj7]hold
[Dbmaj7]I will not hide the truth [Cm7]of this life
The [Bbm7]vision that was given to me
